    "detailed_description": "InkyPen is the best all-you-can-read subscription service for reading Manga &amp; Comics!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The TL;DR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Huge library of awesome Manga &amp; Comics from top publishers<br></li><li>Free range of comics available<br></li><li>Read unlimited comics for a low monthly subscription price</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/34b24060cb4909af18cafd09fae2defa.avif?t=1740484986\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All-You-Can-Read Comics &amp; Manga</h2>Subscribers to InkyPen get FULL access to our range of comics available in their region. Read as much as you want, whenever you want, as long as you have an internet connection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Content Available</h2>We have a range of free comics and samples available for everyone, with more added regularly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hit Titles From Big Publishers</h2>Find the best titles from major international publishers, including Manga, Western Comics, French/Belgian comics, Chinese Manhua, webtoons, comic strips and much, much more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/d84055dd4a3ceb11eae69e55157cfa1f.avif?t=1740484986\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Adaptations</h2>Amongst our comics we also have a large number of videogame and RPG adaptations, letting you dive deeper into the worlds of your favorite fantasy universes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681220/extras/84047181931af1513f2039fbd964948e.avif?t=1740484986\" /></div>",
